{"id":"vod_bf_5666","vodId":"5666","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"翠星之加尔刚蒂亚","name_cn":"翠星之加尔刚蒂亚","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-6/a49e19714faed2f59f9e914a09304cf2.jpg"},"summary":"遥远的未来，地球一度变成冰冻星球。幸存的人类移民外太空，建立了繁荣的殖民星球阿瓦隆，并与外星人成立人类银河联盟。与此同时，名为希迪尔斯的异形肆虐繁殖，与联盟展开旷日持久的战争。在一次针对希迪尔斯母星的战役中，年仅16岁的少尉雷德（石川界人 配音）所在部队遭遇猛烈抵抗。撤退途中，雷德不慎被卷入时空裂缝，与他所驾驶的歼灭兵器钱伯坠落在地球的汪洋中。钱伯被人类打捞到加尔刚蒂亚舰团之上，面对这个与印象中完全不同的人类发源之星，雷德不知所措。在此期间，他和可爱的少女艾米（金元寿子 配音）沟通交流，并成功帮助他们挫败海盗的进攻，赢得地球人的信任。　　由于无法联系到友军，雷德只能暂时留在地球。自幼只知道战斗和服从命令的他，面对这群全无纪律和效率可言的人类，心中最深层的情感慢慢苏醒……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 17:34:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/cuixingzhijiaergangdiya/第12集/inde